    {
      "source": "Decorate the specified <code>contextFactory</code> to set a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/mock/web/MockServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.mock.web\"><code>MockServletContext</code></a>\non each newly created <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>.",
